message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the accompanying article and this release."
title: "A versioned, leakage-audited USGS Did You Feel It? benchmark for retrospective severe felt-intensity prediction"
type: dataset
version: "1.0.4"
date-released: "2026-09-19"
repository-code: "https://github.com/akssha74/dyfi-benchmark-reliability"
url: "https://github.com/akssha74/dyfi-benchmark-reliability/releases/tag/v1.0.4"
license: CC0-1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Sharma
    given-names: Akshay
