keywords:
  - Did You Feel It
  - DYFI
  - USGS
  - macroseismic intensity
  - benchmark resource
  - leakage-safe evaluation
  - sequence-grouped split
abstract: >-
  Version 1 of a frozen, single-source USGS DYFI event-level benchmark for
  retrospective prediction of severe felt intensity from earthquake source
  metadata, with prespecified sequence-grouped roles, a six-category leakage
  audit, fixed reference baselines, and reproducible evaluation outputs.
references:
  - type: data
    title: "USGS Did You Feel It? and ANSS Comprehensive Catalog"
    doi: "10.5066/F7J101C8"
